{
  "name": "Austral WhatsApp administrado - conversación, reserva y confirmación",
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveDataErrorExecution": "none",
    "saveDataSuccessExecution": "none",
    "saveManualExecutions": false
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "qa36-webhook",
      "name": "Ruta QA 36",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        200,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "a7c1e0d2-5b3f-4e61-9a10-0a5a9d1e2f01",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "austral-managed-route",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "australQa928PanelHeader",
          "name": "Austral QA 928 Panel Header"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Autentica antes de aceptar con la credencial QA928 existente. Lo llama whatsapp-evolution-webhook después de persistir el mensaje; luego responde al recibir, sin esperar al proveedor."
    },
    {
      "id": "qa36-guard",
      "name": "Validar ruta QA 36",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        420,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.first()?.json || {};\nconst body = item.body || {};\nconst headers = item.headers || {};\nconst expected = String($env.EVOLUTION_WEBHOOK_SECRET || '');\nconst received = String(headers['x-austral-qa-route-secret'] || '');\nconst tenantId = Number(body.tenant_id);\nconst eventId = String(body.event_id || '');\nif (!expected || received.length !== expected.length || received !== expected) throw new Error('managed_route_unauthorized');\nif (!Number.isSafeInteger(tenantId) || tenantId <= 0 || body.instance !== 'austral-prod-tenant-' + tenantId || body.instance === 'miwsp') throw new Error('managed_route_tenant_rejected');\nif (!Number.isSafeInteger(Number(body.integration_id)) || Number(body.integration_id) <= 0) throw new Error('managed_route_integration_rejected');\nif (!/^[A-Za-z0-9_.:-]{1,200}$/.test(eventId)) throw new Error('managed_route_event_rejected');\nreturn [{ json: { event_id: eventId, tenant_id: tenantId, ready_for_booking_mutation: body.ready_for_booking_mutation === true } }];"
      },
      "notes": "Sólo eventos del tenant QA permitido, con el secreto del webhook QA. El tenant, destinatario y textos los vuelve a decidir Supabase."
    },
    {
      "id": "qa36-if-ready",
      "name": "¿Cliente confirmó?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        640,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "qa36-ready",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.ready_for_booking_mutation }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "qa36-reply",
      "name": "Enviar respuesta",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://ssagttjdgtypxjcgdnrw.supabase.co/functions/v1/whatsapp-agent-outbound-pilot",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpCustomAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ event_id: $('Validar ruta QA 36').first().json.event_id }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 20000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpCustomAuth": {
          "id": "australProdFnSecret",
          "name": "Austral Producción Funciones"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Envía la respuesta persistida al Cliente QA configurado en Supabase (WHATSAPP_OUTBOUND_QA_RECIPIENT). Sin reintento automático.",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 1000
    },
    {
      "id": "qa36-booking",
      "name": "Guardar reserva",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://ssagttjdgtypxjcgdnrw.supabase.co/functions/v1/whatsapp-booking-mutation",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpCustomAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ event_id: $('Validar ruta QA 36').first().json.event_id }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 20000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpCustomAuth": {
          "id": "australProdFnSecret",
          "name": "Austral Producción Funciones"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Revalida la propuesta confirmada y la disponibilidad, y guarda el turno con crear_reserva_whatsapp (idempotente por conversación/versión). Un 409 por horario rechazado sigue al IF en lugar de cortar la ejecución (tarea 41).",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 1000
    },
    {
      "id": "qa36-if-saved",
      "name": "¿Turno guardado?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "qa36-saved",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.booking_created === true && Number.isSafeInteger(Number($json.turno_id)) }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "qa36-confirmation",
      "name": "Enviar confirmación",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1320,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://ssagttjdgtypxjcgdnrw.supabase.co/functions/v1/whatsapp-agent-outbound-pilot",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpCustomAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ event_id: $('Validar ruta QA 36').first().json.event_id, kind: 'booking_confirmation' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 20000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpCustomAuth": {
          "id": "australProdFnSecret",
          "name": "Austral Producción Funciones"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Sólo después de guardar: el texto sale de la fila del turno. Una sola vez por turno.",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 1000
    },
    {
      "id": "qa41-if-rejected",
      "name": "¿Horario rechazado?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1320,
        340
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "qa41-rejected",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.slot_rejected === true && $json.conversation_reopened === true }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Tarea 41: el horario confirmado quedó bloqueado u ocupado y la conversación volvió a elegir horario. No hay turno."
    },
    {
      "id": "qa41-slot-rejected",
      "name": "Ofrecer otro horario",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1540,
        280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://ssagttjdgtypxjcgdnrw.supabase.co/functions/v1/whatsapp-agent-outbound-pilot",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpCustomAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ event_id: $('Validar ruta QA 36').first().json.event_id, kind: 'booking_slot_rejected' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 20000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpCustomAuth": {
          "id": "australProdFnSecret",
          "name": "Austral Producción Funciones"
        }
      },
      "notes": "El servidor arma el texto con el motivo y los horarios vigentes. Una sola vez por evento.",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 1000
    },
    {
      "id": "qa41-not-saved",
      "name": "Reserva no guardada",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1800,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "throw new Error('booking_not_saved:' + String($('Guardar reserva').first()?.json?.error || 'unknown').slice(0, 60) + ':notice_' + String($input.first()?.json?.sent === true ? 'sent' : ($input.first()?.json?.error || 'not_sent')).slice(0, 40));"
      },
      "notes": "Cualquier otro fallo deja la ejecución marcada como error, sin mensaje al cliente."
    },
    {
      "id": "qa928-if-followup",
      "name": "¿Falta elegir barbero?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1320,
        340
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "qa928-followup",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.booking_follow_up === true && $json.conversation_reopened === true }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Recupera una propuesta confirmada antigua con varios profesionales. El servidor persiste la pregunta; Enviar respuesta usa sólo el evento verificado y su reclamo idempotente."
    },
    {
      "id": "b00c1f2a-5e0d-4c55-9a41-0b00c1f2a928",
